stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Received

    state Received: Invoice received by Gimme<br/>RQ-001, RQ-002, RQ-003 applied
    Received --> GatePass: All gate checks pass
    Received --> TypeA_Rejected: Gate check fails<br/>(RQ-001: PoC missing)
    Received --> TypeB_Rejected: Gate check fails<br/>(RQ-002: Uncooperative Register<br/>RQ-003: Payment plan)

    state GatePass: All gate checks passed<br/>Proceed to queue
    GatePass --> CaseAnalyst_Queue: Gate pass

    state CaseAnalyst_Queue: Non-rejected invoices<br/>awaiting case analyst acceptance<br/>RQ-004 active
    CaseAnalyst_Queue --> Batch_Included: Accepted into current batch
    CaseAnalyst_Queue --> Batch_Later: Accepted into later batch

    state Batch_Included: Invoice in current<br/>processing batch
    Batch_Included --> DossierProduced: Processing complete

    state Batch_Later: Invoice queued<br/>for future batch
    Batch_Later --> DossierProduced: Processing complete

    state TypeA_Rejected: Rejection Type A<br/>Missing PoC<br/>RQ-001: No PoC linked<br/>Client may re-submit anytime
    TypeA_Rejected --> Received: Client re-submits

    state TypeB_Rejected: Rejection Type B<br/>Business Rule<br/>RQ-002: Uncooperative Register match<br/>RQ-003: Payment plan match<br/>Not re-applicable
    TypeB_Rejected --> [*]

    state DossierProduced: Debtor dossier produced<br/>System output complete
    DossierProduced --> [*]

    note right of Received
        Gate checks applied in order:
        1. RQ-001: PoC existence (filename match)
           If no PoC found: Type A rejection.
        2. RQ-002: Uncooperative Register
           (if available; log warning if not)
           Debtor in register: Type B rejection.
        3. RQ-003: Payment Plan check
           (if available; log warning if not)
           Active plan exists: Type B rejection.

        Mandatory field enforcement
        (name, address, rekeningnummer,
        phone, invoice number) is handled
        externally at the form level.
        Incomplete submissions never enter
        the system.
    end note

    note right of TypeA_Rejected
        Type A rejection sources:
        - RQ-001: No PoC linked to invoice
        Client receives overview and
        may re-submit without limit.
        Re-submitted invoices enter
        CaseAnalyst_Queue after re-validation.
    end note

    note right of TypeB_Rejected
        Type B rejection sources:
        - RQ-002: Debtor in Uncooperative Register
        - RQ-003: Debtor has active payment plan
        Not re-applicable. Invoice is rejected
        permanently.
        Warning logged if data source unavailable (RQ-005).
    end note

    note right of CaseAnalyst_Queue
        Case analysts manually accept
        non-rejected invoices (RQ-004).
        Each invoice is individually
        accepted into current batch or
        deferred to a later batch.
    end note
